     "titulo": "Organizing an exposition",
     "texto": [
      "A clear exposition presents the problem, develops steps or reasons and closes with a proposal. **Pertama** and **kedua** order arguments; **oleh karena itu** introduces a conclusion.",
      "Do not present reuse as a universal solution: it depends on the material, on safety and on the facilities available. Explain what can be separated and what the destination of each material will be."
